  "supported_claim": "An unselected request that fails is NOT_CAPTURED: no artifact, no boundary observations, no partial reproducer. The failure is still served normally by the application. Rapture therefore cannot claim 'production failed -> artifact exists'; the supported claim is 'production failed AND the request was selected before it executed -> artifact exists'.",
